OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers should soon clear
OL,7,Fthis evening. It will become dry with
OL,8,Fsome clear spells overnight. Light
OL,9,Fwinds throughout. Feeling chilly,
OL,10,Fespecially in rural spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry but mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fstart. Outbreaks of rain spread
OL,14,Feastward later in the afternoon as
OL,15,Fwinds strengthen. Rain turning heavy
OL,16,Fat times in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
